---
import AdminLayout from "../../layouts/AdminLayout.astro";
import AdminRetryNotice from "../../components/admin/AdminRetryNotice.astro";
---

<AdminLayout title="開発者モード" description="運営サイトの接続・ビルド・データ状態を確認します">
  <main class="developer-page" data-developer-page data-admin-load-surface>
    <header class="developer-heading">
      <div>
        <h1>開発者モード</h1>
        <p>通常の運営導線には表示しない、診断・監査・検証用の機能です。</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/admin/manage/?project=atlas">管理トップへ戻る</a>
    </header>

    <p class="developer-mode-note">このページは管理者向けです。日常の作業は管理トップから行い、ここでは異常調査や変更履歴の確認だけを行ってください。</p>

    <details class="developer-mode-details" open>
      <summary>開発者モードの機能を表示</summary>
      <div class="developer-mode-content">
    <section class="diagnostic-panel" aria-labelledby="diagnostic-heading">
      <div class="panel-heading">
        <div><h2 id="diagnostic-heading">確認できる診断情報</h2><p data-diagnostic-generated>未確認</p></div>
        <button type="button" data-diagnostic-retry>再確認</button>
      </div>
      <p class="diagnostic-scope-note">接続・設定の診断です。Cloudflareの配信Versionは、別途デプロイ記録と照合してください。</p>
      <AdminRetryNotice message="診断情報を取得できませんでした。" />
      <div class="diagnostic-state" data-diagnostic-state role="status" aria-live="polite">確認しています…</div>
      <div class="diagnostic-list" data-diagnostic-list hidden></div>
    </section>

    <section class="monitoring-panel" aria-labelledby="scheduled-jobs-heading">
      <div class="panel-heading">
        <div><h2 id="scheduled-jobs-heading">定期処理</h2><p data-scheduled-generated>監視データ未取得</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="diagnostic-scope-note">定期実行の結果とキューの状態を表示します。メール・Discordなど、外部サービスでの到達は別途確認してください。</p>
      <p class="diagnostic-scope-note" data-monitoring-timezone>時刻は端末のタイムゾーンで表示します。</p>
      <div class="monitoring-state" data-scheduled-state data-state="unknown" role="status" aria-live="polite">確認しています…</div>
      <div class="monitoring-grid" data-scheduled-jobs hidden></div>
    </section>

    <section class="monitoring-panel" aria-labelledby="scheduled-queues-heading">
      <div class="panel-heading">
        <div><h2 id="scheduled-queues-heading">処理待ちのキュー</h2><p>再試行待ちは未完了の内数です。待機時間は取得時点の値です。</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="monitoring-state" data-queue-state data-state="unknown" role="status" aria-live="polite">確認しています…</div>
      <div class="monitoring-grid" data-scheduled-queues hidden></div>
    </section>

    <section class="tool-panel" aria-labelledby="tool-heading">
      <div class="panel-heading"><div><h2 id="tool-heading">検証用ページ</h2><p>本番の運営導線には表示しない、確認用のページです。</p></div></div>
      <div class="tool-links">
        <a class="tool-link" href="/admin/ui-prototype/"><strong>UIプロトタイプ</strong><small>画面の検証用ページ</small><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="tool-link" href="/admin/ui-prototype/welcome-screens/" data-prototype-link hidden><strong>ログイン・エラー画面案</strong><small>承認前。本番の画面には未接続</small><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="tool-link" href="/xai-prototype/" data-prototype-link hidden><strong>XAI UIプロトタイプ</strong><small>独立したXAI風サイト案</small><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="tool-link" href="/admin/portal-prototype/" data-prototype-link hidden><strong>ポータル UIプロトタイプ</strong><small>ポータル画面のXAI風デザイン案</small><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="tool-link" href="/admin/ui-review-prototype/" data-prototype-link hidden><strong>運営UIレビュー</strong><small>ポータル・通知・要対応の現行と案</small><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="tool-link" href="/admin/onboarding-demo/"><strong>オンボーディング紹介</strong><small>初回利用の導線を確認</small><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tool-panel" aria-labelledby="audit-heading">
      <div class="panel-heading"><div><h2 id="audit-heading">監査・状態確認</h2><p>日常の運営メニューには表示しない履歴・整合性確認です。</p></div></div>
      <div class="tool-links">
        <a class="tool-link" href="/admin/audit-log/"><strong>操作履歴</strong><small>公開・承認・権限変更</small><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="tool-link" href="/admin/workflow/"><strong>状態遷移・整合性</strong><small>記事とタスクの状態を検証</small><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="tool-link" href="/admin/update-history/"><strong>アップデート履歴</strong><small>管理サイトの変更を確認</small><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="notes-panel" aria-labelledby="notes-heading">
      <h2 id="notes-heading">運用上の注意</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>ここでは設定値そのものや秘密情報は表示しません。</li>
        <li>異常がある場合は、表示された項目と時刻を添えて報告してください。</li>
        <li>本番への変更はGitHubのmainへのPRとWorkers Buildsだけで行います。</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
      </div>
    </details>
  </main>
</AdminLayout>

<style is:global>
  .developer-page { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 980px; padding: 0 1.25rem 4rem; }
  .developer-heading { align-items: end; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-default); display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: space-between; padding: 2rem 0 1.25rem; }
  .developer-heading h1 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); letter-spacing: -.025em; margin: 0; }
  .developer-heading p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: .82rem; margin: .45rem 0 0; }
  .developer-heading a { color: var(--accent-primary); font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 750; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
  .developer-mode-note { border: 1px solid var(--border-default); color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: .76rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 1rem 0 0; padding: .7rem .8rem; }
  .developer-mode-details { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .developer-mode-details > summary { border: 1px solid var(--border-default); color: var(--text-primary); cursor: pointer; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 800; list-style: none; padding: .65rem .8rem; }
  .developer-mode-details > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .developer-mode-details > summary::before { color: var(--text-muted); content: "＋"; display: inline-block; margin-right: .35rem; }
  .developer-mode-details[open] > summary::before { content: "−"; }
  .developer-mode-content { padding-top: .1rem; }
  .diagnostic-panel, .monitoring-panel, .tool-panel, .notes-panel { background: var(--background-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-default); margin-top: 1rem; min-width: 0; padding: 1rem; }
  .diagnostic-scope-note { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: .74rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: .65rem 0; }
  .panel-heading { align-items: start; display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: space-between; }
  .panel-heading h2, .notes-panel h2 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0; }
  .panel-heading p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: .72rem; margin: .3rem 0 0; }
  .panel-heading button { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border-default); border-radius: 6px; color: var(--text-primary); cursor: pointer; font: inherit; font-size: .72rem; padding: .4rem .65rem; }
  .panel-heading button:hover { border-color: var(--accent-primary); color: var(--accent-primary); }
  .diagnostic-state { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: .78rem; padding: 1.5rem .5rem; }
  .diagnostic-state[data-state="error"] { color: var(--danger); }
  .diagnostic-list { border-top: 1px solid var(--border-default); margin-top: .8rem; }
  .diagnostic-row { align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-default); display: grid; gap: .7rem; grid-template-columns: 9rem 5rem minmax(0, 1fr) auto; min-height: 3.2rem; padding: .55rem .2rem; }
  .diagnostic-label { font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .diagnostic-status { font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .diagnostic-status[data-status="ok"] { color: var(--success); }
  .diagnostic-status[data-status="warning"] { color: var(--warning); }
  .diagnostic-status[data-status="error"] { color: var(--danger); }
  .diagnostic-status[data-status="unknown"] { color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .diagnostic-status[data-status="running"] { color: var(--accent-primary); }
  .diagnostic-detail { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: .74rem; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .diagnostic-duration { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .68rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .monitoring-grid { display: grid; gap: .75rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin-top: .8rem; }
  .monitoring-grid[hidden], .diagnostic-list[hidden], .monitoring-state[hidden], .diagnostic-state[hidden] { display: none; }
  .monitoring-state { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.6; padding: .8rem 0; }
  .monitoring-card { border: 1px solid var(--border-default); border-radius: 6px; min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: .8rem; }
  .monitoring-card-heading { align-items: start; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .45rem .8rem; justify-content: space-between; }
  .monitoring-card h3 { font-size: .84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; min-width: 0; }
  .monitoring-card .diagnostic-status { flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.8; }
  .monitoring-card-detail { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: .76rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: .55rem 0; }
  .monitoring-card-meta { color: var(--text-secondary); display: grid; gap: .45rem .65rem; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .9fr) minmax(0, 1.3fr); margin: .7rem 0 0; }
  .monitoring-card-meta dt { font-size: .69rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  .monitoring-card-meta dd { color: var(--text-primary); font-size: .72rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; min-width: 0; }
  .monitoring-card-meta time { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .tool-links { display: grid; gap: .5rem; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin-top: .8rem; }
  .tool-links a { border: 1px solid var(--border-default); color: var(--text-primary); font-size: .78rem; text-decoration: none; }
  .tool-link { display: grid; gap: .25rem; min-height: 4.4rem; padding: .65rem .7rem; }
  .tool-link[data-prototype-link][hidden] { display: none; }
  .tool-link small { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: .68rem; line-height: 1.4; }
  .tool-link span { color: var(--accent-primary); font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 800; margin-top: auto; }
  .tool-links a:hover { border-color: var(--accent-primary); }
  .notes-panel ul { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: .76rem; line-height: 1.7; margin: .7rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) { .developer-page { padding: 0 .8rem 3rem; } .developer-heading { align-items: start; display: grid; } .diagnostic-row { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; } .diagnostic-status { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; } .diagnostic-detail { grid-column: 1 / -1; } .diagnostic-duration { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 3; } .monitoring-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .tool-links { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  @media (max-width: 420px) { .tool-links { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>

<script>
  import "../../scripts/admin-developer-diagnostics";
</script>
